Description: Claude-powered cybersecurity assistant for the terminal
 Claude_Gpt (command: cgpt) is an open-source, Claude-powered assistant for
 cybersecurity work in the terminal. It generates ready-to-run shell commands
 and tooling, answers security questions, and switches between offensive,
 defensive and analysis roles (recon, web, exploit, blueteam, forensics,
 osint, ctf, report).
 .
 Built for Kali Linux and other security workstations. The Python
 dependencies, including the Anthropic SDK, are bundled in a self-contained
 virtualenv under /opt/venvs/cgpt, so no system-wide pip install is needed.
